# YTScrollingKiller

Before changing code, read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the repo map and do/don’t list.

## Conventions

- Flutter Setup companion; English UI only.
- Android: Shorts stay in the browser; block on Shorts id change with Accessibility overlay + Close tab only.
- Do not reintroduce in-app Shorts player takeover on Android.
- No MITM VPN. No YouTube-app intercept.
- Keep `lib/README.md`, `android/README.md`, and `ios/README.md` accurate when changing behavior.
